Cell[TextData[StyleBox["The actual solver is below; right now it is taking a \
crude guess at the initial form.   \n\tnval - number of points \n\trmax - \
width of \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]domain\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \n\t\[Lambda] \
- value of quartic coupling (just in the S-P equation as currently set up) \n\
\torder -- order of the finite differencing; seems to be happy with 9\n\t\n\
Note we have \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]baked in\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] some \
knowledge -- \[Phi] is strictly increasing and f>0\[LineSeparator]",
 FontColor->RGBColor[
  0.00006103608758678569, 0.0018005645838101779`, 
   0.9982299534599832]]], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9578581103299103`*^9, 3.957858156897778*^9}, {
